{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015","id":556807,"title":"E3 2015","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-16T06:12:54-07:00","id":556807,"title":"E3 2015","content":"Many of us here like video games. E3 is happening now. Here are some highlights, for me, from E3:<br /> <br /> Bethesda announced <a href=\"http://www.gamespot.com/articles/dishonored-2-officially-announced-release-window-r/1100-6428075/?ftag=MKT07d7ac6\" target=\"_blank\">Dishonored 2</a> and a release date for <a href=\"http://www.gamespot.com/articles/fallout-4-release-date-announced-at-e3-2015/1100-6428090/?ftag=MKT05eb65e\" target=\"_blank\">Fallout 4</a>. <br /> dontnod (the people behind Life is Strange) are making a <a href=\"http://www.gamespot.com/articles/world-war-1-vampire-rpg-revealed/1100-6424747/\" target=\"_blank\">Vampyr RPG</a> set during WWI.<br /> The next Mass Effect game was announced. It's called <a href=\"http://www.gamespot.com/articles/mass-effect-andromeda-revealed-at-e3-2015/1100-6428135/?ftag=MKTb17ed6a\" target=\"_blank\">Andromeda</a> and the trailer has a line that says, &quot;Discover a new galaxy,&quot; so presumably you'll be exploring the Andromeda galaxy.<br /> And they're remaking <a href=\"http://www.gamespot.com/articles/final-fantasy-7-remake-announced-by-sony-at-e3-201/1100-6428174/?ftag=MKTcbe1876\" target=\"_blank\">Final Fantasy 7 </a>for the PS4 (and possibly other systems at a later date).<br /> <br /> Anything that has tickled your fancy so far?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T07:50:28-07:00","id":556878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015#post556807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They're remaking <a href=\"http://www.gamespot.com/articles/final-fantasy-7-remake-announced-by-sony-at-e3-201/1100-6428174/?ftag=MKTcbe1876\" target=\"_blank\">Final Fantasy 7 </a>for the PS4 (and possibly other systems at a later date).</div> </div> </div> </div>I wish I was more excited about this, but I can't be because Squeenix is Squeenix and I expect them to fuck it up. Hell, they probably have to rebuild the game from the ground up anyway, so it's just too easy to imagine them saying, &quot;As long as we're at it, we may as well scrap the combat system and add in the hands-off autopilot combat of the last ten years, because it's not like we can trust the players to be as cool as we want them to when fighting, right? It should really be more like a movie than a game.&quot;<br /> <br /> Oh well. They can't take my PS version from me.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015#post556807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anything that has tickled your fancy so far?</div> </div> </div> </div><b>South Park: the Fractured but Whole</b>. I'd be more excited if the video showed game footage, though.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T08:43:41-07:00","id":556921,"title":"","content":"I'll likely pick up Final Fantasy 7 for Xbox One. We won't see the game(for any system) until around 2018. You can count on that.<br /> <br /> Other than that, I'm extremely happy with Microsoft's showing, disappointed with Sony, and eagerly awaiting Nintendo in about 20 minutes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T10:48:38-07:00","id":557055,"title":"","content":"Dishonored caused me too much pain with the first one to be excited about the second one. I *might* get it later when it's on sale or the like.<br /> <br /> I'm in not a dissimilar state with the new Mass Effect. Good games, great games, until the ending in which they did not only the cheapest cop out ending possible but one they specifically said they'd never do for that series. So I'm going to wait and maybe pick it up on sale before I get invested in it again. Maybe just wait for the whole series to be out before getting it.<br /> <br /> <br /> Fallout 4? Yeah, I'm getting that. I've been nothing but happy with Bethesda's games (apart from the bugs) so I'm going to upgrade my machine (it's a 5 year old gaming laptop who's design was already largely end-of-life when I got it). Frankly the recent issue with paid mods not withstanding, I've had such good value out of their games that they are the only game company that I don't mind paying full price for the product.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T11:03:58-07:00","id":557067,"title":"","content":"New Hitman, sweet. Apparently Shenmue, too, which my wife is interested in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T14:41:57-07:00","id":557394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557055#post557055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dishonored caused me too much pain with the first one to be excited about the second one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting. I think Dishonored may be my favorite game in my X360 collection. Why did it cause you pain?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557055#post557055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've been nothing but happy with Bethesda's games</div> </div> </div> </div>Dishonored... was published by Bethesda.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557055#post557055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm in not a dissimilar state with the new Mass Effect. Good games, great games, until the ending in which they did not only the cheapest cop out ending possible but one they specifically said they'd never do for that series. So I'm going to wait and maybe pick it up on sale before I get invested in it again. Maybe just wait for the whole series to be out before getting it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Shepherd's story is over. The protagonist for ME4 should be somebody else. I can understand your hesitance, though. It does feel like they're trying to squeeze as much money as possible out of a successful franchise rather than telling the story they set out to tell and then ending it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557055#post557055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fallout 4? Yeah, I'm getting that. I've been nothing but happy with Bethesda's games</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting. I, actually, am not super invested in Fallout 4. I find the Fallout games to be somewhat dull and repetitive. I enjoyed Fallout 3 (which was my introduction to the series) but I couldn't really get into New Vegas because I felt like it was more of the same. I did really like the hardcore mode in New Vegas, and the Mormon expansion interested me, but I didn't own the game so I never bothered looking too deeply into it. (I also don't really find Fallout 3 to be terribly replayable.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557067#post557067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">New Hitman</div> </div> </div> </div>I never got into the Hitman games. I very well might enjoy them, but I never really had interest in picking them up.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557067#post557067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apparently Shenmue, too, which my wife is interested in.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know what that is. Googled it. Looks anime-esque.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T18:45:31-07:00","id":557689,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557394#post557394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interesting. I think Dishonored may be my favorite game in my X360 collection. Why did it cause you pain?</div> </div> </div> </div>The silent unreacting protagonist did me in. I get having to do it for story reasons but between the utter lack of defense against a capital crime and the utter unreaction to people who were practically wearing &quot;WE ARE GOING TO BETRAY YOU&quot; signs, I just couldn't handle it.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557394#post557394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dishonored... was published by Bethesda.</div> </div> </div> </div> I was unaware of this I shall have to lower my opinion of them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557394#post557394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Interesting. I, actually, am not super invested in Fallout 4. I find the Fallout games to be somewhat dull and repetitive. I enjoyed Fallout 3 (which was my introduction to the series) but I couldn't really get into New Vegas because I felt like it was more of the same. I did really like the hardcore mode in New Vegas, and the Mormon expansion interested me, but I didn't own the game so I never bothered looking too deeply into it. (I also don't really find Fallout 3 to be terribly replayable.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I found it very replayable with the efforts of the modding community but that was me. kinda the same with skyrim.<br /> <br /> and Fallout new vegas was very much more of the same with some slight tweaks. it had some of the old school developers so it had some of the weirder humor references, a much bigger problem with invisible walls, but it also had some decent expansions.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T18:58:10-07:00","id":557727,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557689#post557689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I found it very replayable with the efforts of the modding community but that was me. kinda the same with skyrim.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, right. That makes sense. I own it on console, so the mods are unavailable to me.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T21:11:03-07:00","id":557805,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/556807-e3-2015?p=557394#post557394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I never got into the Hitman games. I very well might enjoy them, but I never really had interest in picking them up.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're stealth thriller things. Sort of like Dishonored and Assassin's Creed but in modern times and more 'professional' type of hitman. At least that's the goal, you can try to just rush in and blow everyone away. The last one looked bad, and I avoided it, but the others have been masterpieces. Lots of coming at problems from different angles, different ways to pull off things. I don't usually like replaying games but it was really fun 